          "level": 3,
          "text": "In Scope",
          "type": "heading",
        },
        {
          "items": [
            [
              {
                "text": "Guided Brief-to-SRS pipeline (B-0 through S-9) with per-step gates",
              },
            ],
            [
              {
                "text": "SRS Spine with op-based writes, invariants and deterministic checks",
              },
            ],
            [
              {
                "text": "Five server-rendered PlantUML diagram kinds",
              },
            ],
            [
              {
                "text": "Word export with DRAFT watermark and baseline clean export",
              },
            ],
            [
              {
                "text": "In-app notifications, credit ledger with mock payment gateway",
              },
            ],
            [
              {
                "text": "Read-only admin views for users, metrics and AI cost",
              },
