            {
              "text": "User clicks Revise on a gate card.",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "runs": [
            {
              "bold": true,
              "text": "Description: ",
            },
            {
              "text": "Sends the user's revision notes back to the step within the turn ceiling.",
            },
          ],
          "type": "paragraph",
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "Normal Flow",
          "type": "heading",
        },
        {
          "items": [
            [
              {
                "text": "User enters revision notes.",
              },
            ],
            [
              {
                "text": "System re-runs the step with the notes as context.",
              },
            ],
            [
              {
                "text": "System presents the revised output at the gate again.",
              },
            ],
          ],
          "type": "numbered_list",
        },
        {
          "level": 4,
          "text": "Abnormal Flow",
          "type": "heading",
        },
        {
          "items": [
            [
              {
                "text": "The per-phase turn ceiling of 8 is reached: system offers Accept as-is or a scope note instead of another turn.",
